"NSCameraUsageDescription" = "Loadwise reads the barcodes on food packaging so it can log the food in your diary.";
"NSPhotoLibraryUsageDescription" = "Loadwise loads the photo of a meal or the gym that you pick.";
"NSLocationWhenInUseUsageDescription" = "Loadwise uses your location only when you ask, to show the weather and let the coach advise training outdoors or indoors.";
"NSHealthShareUsageDescription" = "Loadwise reads sleep, workouts, heart rate, HRV, wrist temperature, steps, weight and, with cycle tracking on, periods, ovulation tests and contraception from Apple Health to work out your recovery, strain and calorie target.";
